      "notes": "Peritheos errors-in-variables BM3 refit of the 21 raw 300 K observations in Table I, with the tabulated Mao ruby pressures and lattice-parameter uncertainties. V0 is fixed to the paper's low-temperature 13.394 cm³/mol, converted to the four-atom fcc cell. Not the paper's thermally reduced 0 K fit, which also used the Finger et al. low-pressure data and gave K0 = 1.097 GPa and K0' = 9.23(3).",
